title: FirstLoop_Elegy
---
Elegy: Welcome home, Sasha 
Elegy: I guess death truly has its ways of bringing people back together again. Have you seen your brother yet?

There she is standing in front of you tall and powerful. a figure so well known to all in solster it's impossible to not be starstruck. The Radiant Elegy, The immortal being who established the faith of Solster. A faith so deeply woven in the culture there is almost no distinction between religion and fact. Elegy, a living idol of the church and your brothers boss

-> Yeah, i have 'seen' him..
    You can't help but let your disappointment in your reunion with your brother be known. you can't hide it..
    Elegy: Not the welcoming committee you had hoped for i see. I apologize, truly.
    Elegy: i guess i am partly to blame. Making him run all over town like a headless chicken procuring all we need for the parade and fixing some unsightly details
-> No, not yet..
    Elegy: Hmmm.. i see well, i guess i am partly to blame for that.
    Elegy: Making him run all over town like a headless chicken procuring all we need for the parade and fixing some unsightly details.
    She turns her devine head to the side for a small moment as if she is looking for someone.
    Elegy: Dmitriy should still be on his smoke break right now. You should probably still try and talk to him before the parade starts Sasha.
Elegy: this years parade is extra special you see. I need everything to be perfect.

Elegy takes a couple steps closer to you. her covered face now inches away from yours, A freezing chill runs down your spine.

Elegy: Wouldn't you agree, Sasha? Considering our beloved Alfonz will participate this year as well.

The air feels lighter as she takes a few steps back, the return of the divide between you and her feels like you can finally take a deep breath again. Alfonz…The name sends a wave of shock over you. you still can't believe he’s really gone. fThat you will never hear one of his lectures again. Or hear his soft humming when he believed you to be asleep. Elegy is right. This year is special.

Elegy: You ‘will’ attend the parade today right?

her question sounds more like a demand. Of course you have to be there. She knows that You have to go for Alfonz. No matter your own feelings about the church and its parade. It is what Alfonz would have wanted. it's why you're here right?

-> Yes i will
-> Pff.. Ofcourse!

Elegy smiles at you, while you cant see it clearly from behind her thick veil you know if for certain, She is smiling at your answer.

Elegy: Good. 

Elegy extends her hand, enticing you to move closer.

-> Take her hand 
 You quickly shake her stone cold hand before you quickly step back to your original position. Before you can even properly process the interaction you just had she walks off. back to wandering the streets of Solster, making sure all is in order for the parade.   
-> Do nothing 
    Elegy: Very well.
    And as quickly as she appeared she disappeared again, back to wandering the streets of Solster, making sure all is in order for the parade. 
